<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-001-AO24>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-001-AO24" ;
  triage:title "No completed local (M4) plaintext-vs-baseline comparison recorded for AO.4" ;
  triage:description "No compatible plaintext baseline artifact carrying the required peer_wire_security/execution_daemon provenance exists anywhere in the repo (grep across site/reports/send-message-benchmark/*.json returns zero matches). The AO.4 Physical-Host Evidence Ledger (docs/plans/phase-ao/plan-phase-ao.md:127-137) records the local/M4 tcp/tcp-tls campaign as pending rather than a completed comparison or a valid blocked-host record. M4 is the local development host, not physically unavailable, so pending satisfies neither branch of Acceptance Criterion 4. M5/FastPC4 are correctly recorded blocked -- this finding is specifically about the M4 row. Remediation: execute just benchmark --target tcp and --target tcp-tls locally under the approved isolated-host procedure, commit the resulting baseline artifact with full provenance fields, and update the ledger row from pending to either a passing comparison or a documented benchmark-evidence failure code." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ao2" ;
